# Bot1 activates Mistrise Village on turn 3 ("The next spell you cast this turn can't be countered"), then casts two Lightning
# Bolts at Bot2, who answers each with Counterspell. The first Bolt is marked as it is cast (CR 601.2, 611.2c): the
# Counterspell resolves and does nothing (CR 701.5a) and the Bolt deals 3. The effect is used up by that spell, so the
# second Bolt is countered. Bot1.Pass lets the ability resolve before the Bolt is cast.

